SUMMARY:Yoga in the Park with Didge & Sound Healing Magic!
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nStretch and breathe with the trees! Resto
 rative yoga that is accessible to most. More about Liminal Yoga [here](htt
 p://liminalyoga.com/yoga-classes).\n\nThis is also a special class as Wolf
 gang of the [Luminous Now](https://theluminousnow.com/) be playing the did
 geridoo. The medicine of having these deep\, ancient Earth Vibrations play
 ed on your body is also available for those who want it!\n\nThis class wil
 l meet in the park on a platform\, pending good weather. Meet our wonderfu
 l regular group of yogis.\n\nPlease email me at liminalyoga@gmail.com if y
 ou plan to attend and I can alert you to any weather-related cancellations
 .\n\n$20 for a drop-in or discounts for a class pass. To pay for this clas
 s\, please [go here](https://liminalyoga.com/payment/) for options. Thank 
 you!\n\nPlease bring a mat and any props that you find useful in your prac
 tice.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/awakeningasheville/events/315200844/
